    "title": "The Players Championship 2026 purse, payouts: How much did Cameron Young earn for his win at TPC Swagrass?",
    "text": "Cameron Young pulled off the comeback win.Young, after it looked like Matt Fitzpatrick was going to get out of TPC Sawgrass with the victory, rallied to top Fitzpatrick and claim The Players Championship on Sunday afternoon. He posted a 4-under 68 to overtake Ludvig Åberg and the rest of the field to get to 13-under for the weekend, which was enough to give him the one-shot win in the PGA Tour’s marquee event of the season.AdvertisementAs a result, Young earned a $4.5 million check.[Enter Yahoo Fantasy Bracket Mayhem now for your shot at $50K]Fitzpatrick looked like he was in control down the stretch, but Young held pace and then played the iconic 17th hole and the island green perfectly. That birdie sent him and Fitzpatrick to the final tee tied for the lead.Young then hit what ended up being the longest drive on the 18th hole in the Shotlink era, 375 yards, while Fitzpatrick sent his to the right and into the trees. Fitzpatrick ended up bogeying, which gave Young the win after his two-putt par.AdvertisementThe win is the second of Young’s Tour career. He picked up his first at the Wyndham Championship last season.The Players Championship had a $25 million purse up for grabs, which tops the other signature events this season by $5 million. Here’s a look at how much Young and the rest of the field took home at TPC Sawgrass.1. Cameron Young — $4.5 million2. Matt Fitzpatrick — $2.725 million3. Xander Schauffele — $1.725 million4. Robert MacIntyre — $1.225 millionT5. Sudarshan Yellamaraju, Jacob Bridgeman, Ludvig Åberg — $925,000T8. Tommy Fleetwood, Sepp Straka, Justin Thomas — $731,250T11. Patrick Rodgers, Brian Harman — $606,250T13. Sam Burns, Akshay Bhatia, Brooks Koepka, Ryo Hisatsune, Russell Henley, Justin Rose, Austin Smotherman, Corey Conners, Viktor Hovland — $409,028T22. Scottie Scheffler, Michael Thorbjornsen — $271,250T24. Alex Smalley, J.J. Spaun, William Mouw — $221,250T27. Hideki Matsuyama, Nicolai Højgaard, Chris Kirk, Ryan Gerard, Chad Ramey — $178,650T32. Jordan Spieth, Eric Cole, Bud Cauley, Patrick Cantlay, Andrew Putnam, Alex Noren, Max Homa, Min Woo Lee, Maverick McNealy, Sahith Theegala — $128,250T42. Rickie Fowler, Wyndham Clark, Nick Taylor, Joe Highsmith — $91,250T46. Rory McIlroy, Taylor Pendrith, Matti Schmid, Keith Mitchell — $72,175T50. Taylor Moore, J.T. Poston, Zach Bauchou, Max McGreevy, Si Woo Kim, Keegan Bradley — $61,083T56. Adam Scott, Chris Gotterup — $58,00058. Sam Stevens — $57,250T59. Kevin Roy, Lee Hodges, Jason Day — $56,250T62. Danny Walker, Steven Fisk, Rico Hoey, Stephan Jaeger — $54,500T66. Kristoffer Reitan, Daniel Berger, Nico Echavarria — $52,75069. Michael Brennan — $51,750T70. Ricky Castillo, Tony Finau, Seamus Power — $50,75073. Takumi Kanaya — $49,750",
